{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19089","headline":"送李二十九兄员外赴邠宁使幕 · 刘禹锡","name":"送李二十九兄员外赴邠宁使幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家袭韦平身业文，素风清白至今贫。\n南宫通籍新郎吏，西候从戎旧主人。\n城外草黄秋有雪，烽头烟静虏无尘。\n鼎门爲别霜天晓，賸把离殇三五巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}